• „Plivalište (Banjica) 1“ - stajalište se uspostavlja u ulici Kraljice Ane, 30 metara posle pešačkog prelaza u zoni raskrsnice sa ulicom Crnotravska, za linije br. 34 i 42 - smer ka Ortopedskoj bolnici;
• „Dedinje (Ortopedska bolnica) 1“ - stajalište se uspostavlja u ulici Flore Sends, 15 metara posle izlaza iz parkinga Vojske Srbije, tj. 45 metara posle pešačkog prelaza u zoni raskrsnice sa ulicom Mihaila Avramovića, za liniju br. 34 - smer ka ulici Pere Velimirovića;
• „Dedinje (Ortopedska bolnica) 1“ - u ulici Flore Sends, neposredno ispred pozicije koja se nalazi preko puta izlaza iz parkinga Vojske Srbije, tj. 30 metara ispred pešačkog prelaza u zoni raskrsnice sa ulicom Mihaila Avramovića, za liniju br. 34 - smer ka Topčiderskom brdu.

text_translations.en:
• "Swimming pool (Banjica) 1" - the stop is established in Kraljice Ane Street, 30 meters after the pedestrian crossing in the area of ​​the intersection with Crnotravska Street, for lines no. 34 and 42 - direction to the Orthopedic Hospital;
• "Dedinje (Orthopedic Hospital) 1" - the bus stop is established in Flore Sands Street, 15 meters after the exit from the Serbian Army parking lot, i.e. 45 meters after the pedestrian crossing in the area of ​​the intersection with Mihaila Avramovića Street, for line no. 34 - direction towards Pere Velimirovića street;
• "Dedinje (Orthopedic Hospital) 1" - in Flore Sands Street, directly in front of the position located across the street from the parking lot of the Serbian Armed Forces, i.e. 30 meters in front of the pedestrian crossing in the area of ​​the intersection with Mihaila Avramovića Street, for line no. 34 - direction to Topčiderski brdo.

